# AI Collaboration

- Smallest diff that solves the asked problem
- Ask which layer to touch, or use `@` file references before broad exploration
- Learning mode: explain concepts and show 5–15 line snippets; do not dump full implementations unless asked
- Do not create README or summary docs unless explicitly requested
- Prefer Ask mode for rule drafting; Agent mode only after EN-US text is approved
- One Cursor rule per session; never commit Portuguese in `.cursor/rules/` or `.cursor/skills/`
